{"page":344,"verses":[{"verse_key":"23:28","surah":23,"ayah":28,"ar_uthmani":"فَإِذَا ٱسْتَوَيْتَ أَنتَ وَمَن مَّعَكَ عَلَى ٱلْفُلْكِ فَقُلِ ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ ٱلَّذِى نَجَّىٰنَا مِنَ ٱلْقَوْمِ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and when you and your companions are settled on the Ark, say, “Praise be to God, who delivered us from the wicked people,”","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"23:28"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱسْتَوَيْتَ","en_gloss":"you (have) boarded","transliteration":"is'tawayta","verse_key":"23:28"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنتَ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"anta","verse_key":"23:28"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"23:28"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَّعَكَ","en_gloss":"(is) with you","transliteration":"maʿaka","verse_key":"23:28"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"[on]","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"23:28"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْفُلْكِ","en_gloss":"the ship","transliteration":"l-ful'ki","verse_key":"23:28"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَقُلِ","en_gloss":"then say","transliteration":"faquli","verse_key":"23:28"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","en_gloss":"Praise","transliteration":"l-ḥamdu","verse_key":"23:28"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"(be) to Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"23:28"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"23:28"},{"pos":12,"ar":"نَجَّىٰنَا","en_gloss":"(has) saved us","transliteration":"najjānā","verse_key":"23:28"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"23:28"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","en_gloss":"the people ","transliteration":"l-qawmi","verse_key":"23:28"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"the wrongdoers","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","verse_key":"23:28"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٢٨","en_gloss":"(28)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"23:28"}]},{"verse_key":"23:29","surah":23,"ayah":29,"ar_uthmani":"وَقُل رَّبِّ أَنزِلْنِى مُنزَلًا مُّبَ